  "body": "PS2PSP v0.25.5 Windows x64 preview. Fixes blocked Priority Selection upgrades by allowing controlled, reported texture-only donor exchanges under actual PAC and padded pixel/CLUT budgets. Selected maps never lose measured quality; cranial/cutout guards and material depth remain. Results show selected dimensions/colors, donor count and blocked improvements. Geometry/rigging are unchanged by the texture stage. Includes Maximum Downgrade, existing Default/ATO/Downgrade modes, scalp compatibility, full QA, classic interface, bundled Blender, source and notices; no game assets. Requires your own supported PSP base and Windows 10/11 x64. Main and accepted PACs remain unchanged. PPSSPP validation required; review donor tradeoffs, not only selected maps.\r\n",
